t to sail in the subconscious mind, collect, fight, and implant hope.\n\nYou can interact with the environment and residents in your dreams.\nComplete variou\uff1b\n\n", "short_description": "The goal is to create a dreamland that allows players to enter the game characters, selectively implant emotional seeds, and then harvest the energy of the dream, and finally turn the dream into reality, allowing the player to experience the game, mentally and in the game A VR game where the player characters grow together\u3002"}]}, "developer_name": "TangJunlong", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.jkou.net/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TangJunlong", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.jkou.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ART_CREATIVITY", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "665760168177691"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1670320830983029"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1661750288044969"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2970670659848459"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1343227136319337"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1670320830983029"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781368080, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1670320830983029"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"no